 "notes": "Continuation page (no header). Top row (Ladakhi, all nil) closes the Ramnagar Tehsil block from leaf 254. 'Udhampur District' brace label printed at top left, spanning Udhampur/Ramnagar (leaf 254) and Ramban, Kishtwar, Bhadarwah Tehsils here; the five tehsils' Dogri figures sum to Part I Udhampur District Dogri 87,665. Last block labelled 'Riasi Tehsil' within 'Riasi District' (printed spelling; path uses Part I name 'Reasi District'); block continues on leaf 256. All-nil rows omitted: Ramban Chabhali/Ladakhi; Kishtwar Chabhali/Pothwari/Balti; Bhadarwah Chabhali/Balti/Ladakhi. Remarks column empty. PRINT INCONSISTENCIES kept as printed: (1) Ramban Tehsil Kashmiri mother-tongue Persons printed 31,036 but Males 17,151 + Females 14,785 = 31,936; the tehsil Kashmiri totals of Udhampur District sum to Part I Udhampur District Kashmiri 76,494 only with 31,936, so 31,036 is a misprint. (2) Bhadarwah Tehsil Panjabi mother-tongue Persons printed 288 but 179 + 107 = 286; with 286 the Udhampur District tehsils sum to Part I Udhampur District Punjabi 3,065 (males 2,532 also agree), so 288 is a misprint. Both are confirmed again by the Jammu Province totals on leaf 251 (Kashmiri 121,431; Panjabi 306,835) and by Part II(B) leaves 267-268, which print 31,936 and 286."
}